{"name": "Wonderia", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 'Wonderia', a unique open-world game set on an alien planet. Your journey combines survival, creativity, and exploration in a dynamic, procedurally generated environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a vast, ever-changing sandbox world. Uncover resources and secrets hidden across diverse landscapes, each offering unique challenges and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"284\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/dcd55bd44f4e38c65cea2585998c670d.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/dcd55bd44f4e38c65cea2585998c670d.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/dcd55bd44f4e38c65cea2585998c670d.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and customize homes for space travelers, influencing them to make this world their new home. Your constructions directly affect the planet's landscape and ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"244\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/3f9988d91fe6dfeab0cf4fa6a6ab9457.avif?t=1785405495\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"284\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/d2e36d503e4c8ad6449afbc570a24261.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/d2e36d503e4c8ad6449afbc570a24261.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/d2e36d503e4c8ad6449afbc570a24261.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into mysterious dungeons scattered across the planet. Navigate through complex labyrinths and uncover hidden treasures in these subterranean realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"284\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/732b151ffeefb8754e28dbe0b43a6035.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/732b151ffeefb8754e28dbe0b43a6035.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/732b151ffeefb8754e28dbe0b43a6035.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate an alien garden, planting seeds collected on your travels. Delve into the art of fishing, capturing exotic aquatic species in hidden nooks of the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"284\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/5b15ffecfef7fceb927ed326cdf3e4c0.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/5b15ffecfef7fceb927ed326cdf3e4c0.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/5b15ffecfef7fceb927ed326cdf3e4c0.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with your harvests and catches in the kitchen, concocting culinary creations that offer surprising benefits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy 'Wonderia' solo or with up to 7 others in multiplayer mode. Work together or compete in constructing, exploring, and surviving on this alien planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'Wonderia' offers a blend of adventure and creativity, where your decisions shape the world and your experience in this alien landscape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"284\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/9ccd77801526cabf704c9a44447e38ef.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/9ccd77801526cabf704c9a44447e38ef.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/9ccd77801526cabf704c9a44447e38ef.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Wonderia's an open-world, manga-art adventure just waiting to be explored. It's got sci-fi sim elements, deep dungeons, and you can even morph into alien form! Grab up to 7 friends to mine, craft, battle, and level\u2014or farm and fish the day away, if that's more your tempo. There's so much to do!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/28c5418e6db35aa2dd4c35de14bae164b28eb58b/header.jpg?t=1785405495", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Open World Survival Craft", "Online Co-Op", "Sandbox", "Survival", "2D"], "developers": "Rock&Dash", "publishers": "Rock&Dash", "release_date": "Jul 22, 2026", "price": "$13.99", "appid": "2593340", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "13 June 2025 - Request Access\n\n7 November 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/nPXqOm0dovw", "first_seen": 1749772800.0, "review_rank": 1573}